|ap_idle          |  out|    1|  ap_ctrl_hs|    run_dwconv|  return value|
|ap_ready         |  out|    1|  ap_ctrl_hs|    run_dwconv|  return value|
|d_val            |   in|  704|     ap_none|         d_val|        scalar|
|in_base_read     |   in|    8|     ap_none|  in_base_read|        scalar|
|w_base_read      |   in|    8|     ap_none|   w_base_read|        scalar|
|b_base_read      |   in|   32|     ap_none|   b_base_read|        scalar|
|out_base         |  out|    8|      ap_vld|      out_base|       pointer|
|out_base_ap_vld  |  out|    1|      ap_vld|      out_base|       pointer|
